<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs down six at 59.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs down six at 59.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs operating offshore northwest Europe totalled 59 in the week ending June 25, down six from the previous week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>There were 30 rigs drilling in British waters, down five on the week ending June 18, while the Norwegian sector was up one at 15. The Netherlands and Denmark were one rig down each at 10 and three respectively.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
